# Coffee Shop Microservices Architecture Map

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    Client[Browser / Mobile]
    Frontend[frontend\nReact + Nginx]
    Gateway[api-gateway\nNestJS]
    User[user-service\nSpring Boot]
    Table[table-service\nSpring Boot]
    Order[order-service\nNestJS + Prisma]
    Chat[chat-service\nNestJS + Socket.IO]
    Inventory[inventory-service\nNestJS + Prisma]
    Payment[payment-service\nNestJS + Prisma]
    Report[report-service\nNestJS + Prisma]
    AI[ai-service\nFastAPI]
    Postgres[(PostgreSQL)]
    Redis[(Redis)]
    Kafka[(Kafka)]

    Client --> Frontend
    Frontend --> Gateway

    Gateway --> User
    Gateway --> Table
    Gateway --> Order
    Gateway --> Chat
    Gateway --> Inventory
    Gateway --> Payment
    Gateway --> Report
    Gateway --> AI

    User --> Postgres
    Table --> Postgres
    Order --> Postgres
    Chat --> Postgres
    Inventory --> Postgres
    Payment --> Postgres
    Report --> Postgres
    AI --> Postgres

    Gateway --> Redis
    Chat --> Redis

    Order --> Kafka
    Inventory --> Kafka
    Report --> Kafka
    AI --> Kafka
```

```mermaid
flowchart TB
    subgraph Roles[User Roles]
        Customer[Customer]
        Staff[Staff]\nWAITER / BARISTA / STAFF
        Manager[Manager]
        Admin[Admin]
    end

    subgraph GatewayRules[API Gateway Rules]
        Public[Public routes\n/api/users/login\n/api/orders/menu\n/api/tables/*/qr\n/api/chats]
        BranchScoped[Branch-scoped routes\n/orders\n/tables\n/inventory\n/reports]
        AdminOnly[Admin-only routes\n/branches CRUD\n/staff management\n/system settings]
    end

    Customer --> Public
    Staff --> BranchScoped
    Manager --> BranchScoped
    Manager --> AdminOnly
    Admin --> AdminOnly
```

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Customer
    participant F as Frontend
    participant G as API Gateway
    participant T as Table Service
    participant O as Order Service
    participant K as Kafka
    participant S as Staff / KDS

    C->>F: Scan QR / open menu
    F->>G: GET /api/orders/menu?tableId=...
    G->>T: Validate table
    T-->>G: table valid
    G->>O: Fetch menu
    O-->>G: menu items
    G-->>F: menu items
    F-->>C: Show menu
    C->>F: Place order
    F->>G: POST /api/orders
    G->>O: Create order
    O->>K: Publish OrderCreated
    K-->>S: OrderCreated event
    O-->>G: order result
    G-->>F: order result
    F-->>C: Confirmation
```

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Admin / Manager
    participant F as Frontend
    participant G as API Gateway
    participant U as User Service
    participant R as Report Service
    participant I as Inventory Service

    A->>F: Open admin screen
    F->>G: Request branch-scoped data
    G->>G: RBAC + branch validation
    G->>U: Staff / branch / attendance APIs
    G->>R: Reports APIs
    G->>I: Inventory APIs
    U-->>G: user data
    R-->>G: report data
    I-->>G: inventory data
    G-->>F: aggregated response
```

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Customer / Staff
    participant F as Frontend
    participant G as API Gateway
    participant Ch as Chat Service
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant WS as Socket.IO Clients

    C->>F: Open chat
    F->>G: POST /api/chats
    G->>Ch: Create or open chat
    Ch->>DB: Store chat session
    Ch-->>G: chat session
    G-->>F: chat session
    F->>G: POST /api/chats/{id}/messages
    G->>Ch: Send message
    Ch->>DB: Store message
    Ch-->>WS: Emit new-message
    Ch-->>G: message accepted
    G-->>F: message accepted
```

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant M as Manager / Staff
    participant F as Frontend
    participant G as API Gateway
    participant P as Payment Service
    participant O as Order Service
    participant W as SePay / Webhook

    M->>F: Start payment flow
    F->>G: POST /api/v1/payments
    G->>P: Create payment
    P-->>G: paymentId
    G-->>F: paymentId
    F->>G: POST /api/v1/payments/{paymentId}/confirm-cash
    G->>P: Confirm cash payment
    P->>O: Update order/payment state
    P-->>G: payment complete
    G-->>F: payment complete
    W->>P: Online payment webhook / return
    P->>O: Sync final payment state
```

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant M as Manager / Admin
    participant F as Frontend
    participant G as API Gateway
    participant I as Inventory Service
    participant O as Order Service

    M->>F: Edit ingredients / stock
    F->>G: POST /api/v1/ingredients
    G->>I: Create ingredient
    I-->>G: ingredient created
    G-->>F: created
    F->>G: POST /api/v1/ingredients/stock/import
    G->>I: Record stock import
    I-->>G: stock updated
    G-->>F: stock updated
    O->>I: Sync menu / recipe stock
    I-->>O: sync result
```

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Admin / Manager
    participant F as Frontend
    participant G as API Gateway
    participant R as Report Service
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    A->>F: Open dashboard
    F->>G: GET /api/reports/dashboard
    G->>R: Fetch report data
    R->>DB: Query analytics tables
    DB-->>R: report data
    R-->>G: dashboard payload
    G-->>F: dashboard payload
    F-->>A: Render charts
```

```mermaid
flowchart TB
